---
// The table's journey, promoted to the lead scene (founder 2026-08-05: "move
// the table's story up where Tango is"). Its map beside the screen that makes
// it real — a marketplace listing the assistant has already matched, with the
// delivery route it drew.
import PhoneFrame from './PhoneFrame.astro';
import AppIcon from './AppIcon.astro';
import ScenePair from './ScenePair.astro';
const PLANTS = '#98BE4D';
interface Stop {
  emoji: string; x: number; y: number;
  name: string; sub: string; sub2?: string; sub2color?: string;
  lx: number; ly: number; anchor: 'start' | 'end' | 'middle';
}
const TABLE_STOPS: Stop[] = [
  { emoji: '🌳', x: 44, y: 44, name: 'the tree', sub: '50 years of growing', lx: 66, ly: 46, anchor: 'start' },
  { emoji: '🪚', x: 200, y: 58, name: 'the artisan', sub: '7 hours of craft', lx: 222, ly: 54, anchor: 'start' },
  { emoji: '🥕', x: 120, y: 128, name: 'the farm', sub: 'clean food loaded', lx: 98, ly: 124, anchor: 'end' },
  { emoji: '🏠', x: 240, y: 150, name: 'a neighbor', sub: 'pays for produce', lx: 262, ly: 134, anchor: 'start' },
  { emoji: '🏠', x: 120, y: 210, name: 'another neighbor', sub: 'covered by the commons', sub2: 'plants trees in return', sub2color: PLANTS, lx: 98, ly: 214, anchor: 'end' },
  { emoji: '🏡', x: 284, y: 258, name: 'the family’s kitchen', sub: 'the table, earned by the drive', lx: 272, ly: 288, anchor: 'middle' },
];
---
<ScenePair eyebrow="The table's journey">
  <svg slot="map" viewBox="0 0 340 310" role="img"
    aria-label="A map route: from the tree that grew the wood, to the artisan who crafted the table, to the farm where clean food is loaded in, to one neighbor who pays for produce and another covered by the commons, ending at the family’s kitchen — the table earned by the drive.">
    <path d="M-10,104 q45,-14 90,0 t90,0 t90,0 t90,0" fill="none" stroke="var(--bone-edge)" stroke-width="0.9" opacity="0.55" />
    <path d="M-10,168 q45,12 90,0 t90,0 t90,0 t90,0" fill="none" stroke="var(--bone-edge)" stroke-width="0.9" opacity="0.45" />
    <path d="M-10,268 q45,-8 90,0 t90,0 t90,0 t90,0" fill="none" stroke="var(--bone-edge)" stroke-width="0.9" opacity="0.4" />
    <path d="M44,44 C90,14 152,32 200,58 C232,78 160,96 120,128 C90,152 190,142 240,150 C288,178 170,180 120,210 C96,226 180,232 232,246"
      fill="none" stroke="var(--peach)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 6" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <g transform="translate(248,251) scale(-1,1)"><text x="0" y="0" font-size="13" text-anchor="middle">🚚</text></g>
    <path d="M110,198 C50,184 10,160 10,112 C10,72 18,52 38,46"
      fill="none" stroke={PLANTS} stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="3 5" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.85" />
    <text x="60" y="158" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle">🌱</text>
    {TABLE_STOPS.map((s) => (
      <g>
        <circle cx={s.x} cy={s.y} r="16" fill="var(--bone-warm)" stroke="var(--bone-edge)" stroke-width="1.2" />
        <text x={s.x} y={s.y + 5} font-size="14" text-anchor="middle">{s.emoji}</text>
        <text x={s.lx} y={s.ly} font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)" text-anchor={s.anchor}>{s.name}</text>
        <text x={s.lx} y={s.ly + 12} font-size="9" font-style="italic" fill="var(--ink-soft)" text-anchor={s.anchor}>{s.sub}</text>
        {s.sub2 && <text x={s.lx} y={s.ly + 24} font-size="9" font-style="italic" fill={s.sub2color} text-anchor={s.anchor}>{s.sub2}</text>}
      </g>
    ))}
  </svg>

  <PhoneFrame slot="phone" initial="J" active="home" mark={false}>
    <div class="tbl">
      <img class="tbl-photo" src="/img/2026/01/table-listing.jpg" alt="A hand-built wooden dining table." loading="lazy" />
      <p class="tbl-title">Hand-built white oak table</p>
      <p class="tbl-offer">Gift · Lichen routes <span class="tbl-by">by Marco Ruiz</span></p>

      <div class="tbl-match">
        <span class="tbl-match-brain"><AppIcon name="brain" size={13} /></span>
        <div>
          <p class="tbl-match-line"><strong>Matched to the Alvarez family</strong> — the dimensions fit their kitchen, and the style matches what they keep.</p>
          <span class="tbl-match-chip">See the route &rarr;</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="tbl-label">The route your assistant drew</p>
      <div class="tbl-route">
        <p class="tbl-stop"><span>1</span> Load clean food at River &amp; Root Farm</p>
        <p class="tbl-stop"><span>2</span> Two deliveries on the way — one paid, one carried</p>
        <p class="tbl-stop tbl-stop--end"><span>3</span> Home, with the table</p>
      </div>
      <p class="tbl-foot">41 miles · borrowed truck, approved by Sandoval Hauling</p>
    </div>
  </PhoneFrame>

  <Fragment slot="capmap">
    In the current economy the table goes to whoever browses at the right moment and pays.
    Here, the web of need and contribution is matched to minimize waste and maximize
    quality of life — for every living being on the route.
  </Fragment>
  <Fragment slot="capphone">
    A family who can&rsquo;t afford the table earns it by driving the neighborhood&rsquo;s
    food. One neighbor pays for their produce; the commons carries the other. Lichen
    remembers the tree&rsquo;s fifty years, the artisan&rsquo;s hours and the family&rsquo;s
    miles — and the story returns to each of them.
  </Fragment>
</ScenePair>

<style>
  .tbl { padding: 10px 12px 12px; }
  .tbl-photo { display: block; width: 100%; height: 92px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: var(--r-md); }
  .tbl-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.25; }
  .tbl-offer { font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--peach-deep); margin-top: 2px; }
  .tbl-by { color: var(--ink-muted); }
  .tbl-match {
    display: flex; gap: 7px; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 9px;
    background: var(--bone-warm); border: 1px solid var(--peach); border-radius: var(--r-md);
    padding: 8px 10px;
  }
  .tbl-match-brain { color: var(--peach-deep); flex-shrink: 0; display: inline-flex; }
  .tbl-match-line { font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .tbl-match-line strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
  .tbl-match-chip {
    display: inline-block; margin-top: 5px; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--peach-deep); border: 1px solid var(--peach); border-radius: var(--r-full);
    padding: 2px 8px;
  }
  .tbl-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-faint); margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .tbl-route { margin-top: 4px; }
  .tbl-stop {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
    font-size: 10px; color: var(--ink-soft);
    padding: 5px 2px; border-top: 1px solid var(--bone-edge-soft);
  }
  .tbl-stop span {
    width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0;
    background: var(--bone-warm); border: 1px solid var(--bone-edge);
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 7px; color: var(--ink-muted);
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }
  .tbl-stop--end { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
  .tbl-foot { font-size: 9px; color: var(--ink-faint); margin-top: 7px; font-style: italic; }
</style>
